Package: gotNeRve
Title: Predict Nerve Infiltration Status from RNA-seq Expression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Cailin", "Deiter", , "cailin.deiter@cuanschutz.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Config-driven gene-signature pipeline for predicting nerve
    infiltration status from RNA-seq expression: counts -> CPM -> gene
    filtering -> elastic-net model training with a bootstrapped stability
    filter. Includes gotNeRve() for scoring new counts, CPM, or
    log2-CPM data against the bundled trained model.
